//
//  * u3x_retag_mm_vote(page): on the vote page (0xe35f0f1a), the vote list widget (0xdc6e89d8, enum 21, kind 0x50, no
//    source) is handed to the helper: kind 0xcf, source 0x4c414e50 (counted in eb[170]).
//  * u3x_mmv_netgame / u3x_mmv_playlist / u3x_mmv_rule: entries of the net-game (0xd0), playlist (0x98, by id) and rule
//    (0x58; an empty rule when out of range) tables of the menu's symbols.
//  * u3x_mmv_coop(base, s): the current mode (by the game's mode key; any mode when the key is 0; on LAN only the
//    modes of the current co-op setting) is a co-op mode.
//  * u3x_mmv_diff(base, s, n): the name of difficulty n (none past the five).
//  * u3x_mmv_source(base, ev, s): the data source 0x4c414e50 of the vote list: only while a vote runs on the vote tab
//    in the right lobby state; row 0 / 1 = the two candidates. Texts: the header (" " once voting closed, else "vote"),
//    the playlist name, the rules or the mode name (co-op: "<rules> <difficulty>"), the playlist with its
//    description; the map picture (the n06 path when on, else the playlist's map icon); selection; two rows; and the
//    queries (votes, "changed", "more than one candidate", the result word; others to the C side's n08). Counted in
//    eb[171..173].
