// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- row 13
// The Cinema (film) HUD's tab bar (PS3 1.19 f_664c7c, b023): a list of up to 14 tabs that the film state filters,
// moved with up / down (auto-repeat), confirmed with the confirm button, fading out while a menu page is open.
//
// The element (HUD + 0x2408): +0 cursor, +4 smoothed cursor (float), +8 page waiting to be sent; 14 tabs of 24 bytes at
// +0xc (+0 page, +4 second page); +0x15c tab count; +0x160 the visible tabs (pointers), +0x1d0 their count; +0x1d4
// alpha, +0x1d8 time. Counters eb[200] stub entries, [201] updates, [202] screenshot skips, [203] draws skipped, [204]
// pages sent, [205] cursor guard, [206] visible tabs, [207] callee check failures, [208] last page.
//
//  * u3x_k29_eok(p): p can be a game object (at least 0x10000, below 2^47, 4-aligned).
//  * u3x_k23_callees(base): the three game functions the bar calls (menu action, sound start / stop) begin with the
//    usual prologue; checked once, each failure counted.
//  * u3x_k23_rep(base, pad, mask): the button fires: just pressed, or held past 0.2 s and crossing a repeat step (every
