// content ships in the overlay are marked installed (U3MP_DLC_PACKS=0, state +0x20c0 bit 7, leaves them).
// State +0x3e40: [0] ticks, [1] list changes, [2] requests, [3] used entries, [4..47] per-slot / first failing slot.
